tat-description">From request to a ready browser.</dd></div></dl></section><section id="platform" class="editorial-section"><h2 class="editorial-detail-heading">Browsers, compute, and web data.</h2><div class="editorial-products"><article id="product-browsers" class="editorial-product" aria-labelledby="product-browsers-title"><div class="editorial-product-name"><svg class="product-mark" data-kind="browsers" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="2.5" y="4" width="19" height="16" rx="1.5"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path><g fill="currentColor" stroke="none"><circle cx="5.5" cy="6.5" r="0.6"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="6.5" r="0.6"></circle><circle cx="10.5" cy="6.5" r="0.6"></circle></g></svg><h3 id="product-browsers-title">Browsers</h3></div><div class="editorial-product-copy"><h4>Control Chrome through an API</h4><p>Connect Playwright or Puppeteer to a cloud-hosted Chrome session. Save logins between runs and inspect sessions live.</p><a class="editorial-text-link" href="/browser-sessions">Explore <!-- -->browsers<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><figure class="product-demo" aria-label="Example workflow: browsing GitHub repositories" data-kind="browsers" data-playing="true"><div><div class="product-demo-scene" data-in="false"><div class="relative w-full overflow-clip " style="aspect-ratio:416 / 262"><div class="absolute top-0" style="width:416px;height:262px;zoom:1;left:0"><div class="absolute h-[380px] w-[560px]" style="left:-72px;top:-56px"><div class="dz-in absolute flex flex-col overflow-hidden font-sans" style="left:72px;top:56px;width:416px;height:262px;background:var(--scene-window-bg, rgb(var(--win) / 0.9));border-radius:var(--scene-window-radius, 12px);backdrop-filter:var(--scene-window-blur, blur(10px));border:var(--scene-window-border, 1px solid rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.12));box-shadow:var(--scene-window-shadow, 0 30px 60px -30px rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.45), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04));color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.84)"><div class="scene-window-toolbar flex h-7 flex-none items-center gap-1 border-b px-3" style="border-color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.08)"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.18)"></span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.18)"></span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.18)"></span><div class="ml-3"><div role="tablist" aria-label="Browser demo views" class="scene-tabs"><button type="button" role="tab" id="_R_ecklu5b_-tab-0" aria-controls="_R_ecklu5b_-panel" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">Browser</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="_R_ecklu5b_-tab-1" aria-controls="_R_ecklu5b_-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Code</button></div></div><span class="ml-auto font-mono text-[10px]" style="color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.3)">Chrome</span></div><div class="scene-window-content relative flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col" role="tabpanel" id="_R_ecklu5b_-panel" aria-labelledby="_R_ecklu5b_-tab-0" tabindex="0"><video class="h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-1 bg-white object-cover" src="/product-demos/browser-workflow.mp4" poster="/product-demos/browser-workflow.webp" preload="auto" muted="" loop="" playsInline="" disablePictureInPicture="" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></video></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><figcaption><span>Example workflow: browsing GitHub repositories</span><button type="button" aria-label="Pause browsers demo"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pause" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="14" y="3" width="5" height="18" rx="1"></rect><rect x="5" y="3" width="5" height="18" rx="1"></rect></svg>Pause</button></figcaption></figure></article><article id="product-sandboxes" class="editorial-product" aria-labelledby="product-sandboxes-title"><div class="editorial-product-name"><svg class="product-mark" data-kind="sandboxes" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 3H3v6m12-6h6v6M3 15v6h6m12-6v6h-6M9 9h6v6H9z"></path></svg><h3 id="product-sandboxes-title">Sandboxes</h3></div><div class="editorial-product-copy"><h4>Run code in isolated environments</h4><p>Install dependencies, execute commands, and expose local services. Save the environment as a snapshot to reuse in later runs.</p><a class="editorial-text-link" href="/sandboxes">Explore <!-- -->sandboxes<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><figure class="product-demo" aria-label="Create, run, and snapshot with the SDK" data-kind="sandboxes" data-playing="true"><div><div class="product-demo-scene" data-in="false" aria-hidden="true"><div class="relative w-full overflow-clip " style="aspect-ratio:416 / 280"><div class="absolute top-0" style="width:416px;height:280px;zoom:1;left:0"><div class="absolute h-[380px] w-[560px]" style="left:-72px;top:-28px"><div class="dz-in absolute flex flex-col overflow-hidden font-sans" style="left:72px;top:28px;width:416px;height:280px;background:var(--scene-window-bg, rgb(var(--win) / 0.9));border-radius:var(--scene-window-radius, 12px);backdrop-filter:var(--scene-window-blur, blur(10px));border:var(--scene-window-border, 1px solid rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.12));box-shadow:var(--scene-window-shadow, 0 30px 60px -30px rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.45), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04));color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.84)"><div class="scene-window-toolbar flex h-7 flex-none items-center gap-1 border-b px-3" style="border-color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.08)"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.18)"></span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.18)"></span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.18)"></span><span class="ml-3 text-[10.5px]" style="color:rgb(var(--win-ink));border-bottom:1px solid rgb(var(--win-ink));padding-bottom:1px">sandbox.ts</span><span class="ml-auto font-mono text-[10px]" style="color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.3)">Node.js</span></div><div class="scene-window-content relative flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col"><div class="sandbox-code"><div class="sandbox-code-line" data-visible="true"><span>1</span><code><span>const vm = await client.sandboxes.create({</span></code></div><div class="sandbox-code-line" data-visible="true"><span>2</span><code><span>  imageName: </span><span class="sandbox-code-string">&quot;node&quot;</span><span>,</span></code></div><div class="sandbox-code-line" data-visible="true"><span>3</span><code><span>});</span></code></div><div class="sandbox-code-line" data-visible="true"><span>4</span><code><span></span></code></div><div class="sandbox-code-line" data-visible="false"><span>5</span><code><span>await vm.exec(</span><span class="sandbox-code-string">&quot;echo Sandbox ready&quot;</span><span>);</span></code></div><div class="sandbox-code-line" data-visible="false"><span>6</span><code><span></span></code></div><div class="sandbox-code-line" data-visible="false"><span>7</span><code><span>await vm.createMemorySnapshot({</span></code></div><div class="sandbox-code-line" data-visible="false"><span>8</span><code><span>  snapshotName: </span><span class="sandbox-code-string">&quot;node-base&quot;</span><span>,</span></code></div><div class="sandbox-code-line" data-visible="false"><span>9</span><code><span>});</span></code></div></div><div class="sandbox-output"><span>OUTPUT</span><code> </code><code class="sandbox-snapshot"> </code></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><figcaption><span>Create, run, and snapshot with the SDK</span><button type="button" aria-label="Pause sandboxes demo"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pause" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="14" y="3" width="5" height="18" rx="1"></rect><rect x="5" y="3" width="5" height="18" rx="1"></rect></svg>Pause</button></figcaption></figure></article><article id="product-web" class="editorial-product" aria-labelledby="product-web-title"><div class="editorial-product-name"><svg class="product-mark" data-kind="web" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m7 6-5 6 5 6m10-12 5 6-5 6M14 3l-4 18"></path></svg><h3 id="product-web-title">Web API</h3></div><div class="editorial-product-copy"><h4>Extract data from websites</h4><p>Fetch a page, crawl a site, or search the web. Return Markdown, HTML, screenshots, or JSON that matches your schema.</p><a class="editorial-text-link" href="/web-apis">Explore <!-- -->the Web API<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><figure class="product-demo" aria-label="Fetch a page as Markdown and links" data-kind="web" data-playing="true"><div><div class="product-demo-scene" data-in="false"><div class="relative w-full overflow-clip " style="aspect-ratio:416 / 324"><div class="absolute top-0" style="width:416px;height:324px;zoom:1;left:0"><div class="absolute h-[380px] w-[560px]" style="left:-72px;top:-28px"><div class="dz-in absolute flex flex-col overflow-hidden font-sans" style="left:72px;top:28px;width:416px;height:324px;background:var(--scene-window-bg, rgb(var(--win) / 0.9));border-radius:var(--scene-window-radius, 12px);backdrop-filter:var(--scene-window-blur, blur(10px));border:var(--scene-window-border, 1px solid rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.12));box-shadow:var(--scene-window-shadow, 0 30px 60px -30px rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.45), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04));color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.84)"><div class="scene-window-toolbar flex h-7 flex-none items-center gap-1 border-b px-3" style="border-color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.08)"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.18)"></span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.18)"></span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.18)"></span><span class="ml-3 text-[10.5px]" style="color:rgb(var(--win-ink));border-bottom:1px solid rgb(var(--win-ink));padding-bottom:1px">Web API</span><span class="ml-auto font-mono text-[10px]" style="color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.3)">Fetch</span></div><div class="scene-window-content relative flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col"><pre class="fetch-example-request"><code>await client.web.fetch({
  url: &quot;https://example.com&quot;,
  outputs: { formats: [&quot;markdown&quot;, &quot;links&quot;] }
});</code></pre><div class="fetch-example-response"><div class="fetch-example-formats"><div role="tablist" aria-label="Web API output format" class="scene-tabs"><button type="button" role="tab" id="_R_esklu5b_-tab-0" aria-controls="_R_esklu5b_-panel" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">Markdown</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="_R_esklu5b_-tab-1" aria-controls="_R_esklu5b_-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Links</button></div><span class="fetch-example-status" style="color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.46)">fetching…</span></div><pre id="_R_esklu5b_-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="_R_esklu5b_-tab-0" tabindex="0" style="opacity:0.35"><code>Reading the page…</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><figcaption><span>Fetch a page as Markdown and links</span><button type="button" aria-label="Pause web demo"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pause" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="14" y="3" width="5" height="18" rx="1"></rect><rect x="5" y="3" width="5" height="18" rx="1"></rect></svg>Pause</button></figcaption></figure></article><article id="product-agents" class="editorial-product" aria-labelledby="product-agents-title"><div class="editorial-product-name"><svg class="product-mark" data-kind="agents" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2v6m0 8v6M2 12h6m8 0h6M5 5l4 4m6 6 4 4M5 19l4-4m6-6 4-4"></path></svg><h3 id="product-agents-title">AI Agents</h3></div><div class="editorial-product-copy"><h4>Run browser tasks from a prompt</h4><p>Run HyperAgent, Browser Use, or computer-use models in a managed browser. Send a task, inspect the steps, and retrieve the result.</p><a class="editorial-text-link" href="/ai-agents">Explore <!-- -->agents<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><figure class="product-demo" aria-label="Example workflow: searching Google Flights" data-kind="agents" data-playing="true"><div><div class="product-demo-scene" data-in="false" aria-hidden="true"><div class="relative w-full overflow-clip " style="aspect-ratio:416 / 294"><div class="absolute top-0" style="width:416px;height:294px;zoom:1;left:0"><div class="absolute h-[380px] w-[560px]" style="left:-72px;top:-17px"><div class="dz-in absolute flex flex-col overflow-hidden font-sans" style="left:72px;top:17px;width:416px;height:294px;background:var(--scene-window-bg, rgb(var(--win) / 0.9));border-radius:var(--scene-window-radius, 12px);backdrop-filter:var(--scene-window-blur, blur(10px));border:var(--scene-window-border, 1px solid rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.12));box-shadow:var(--scene-window-shadow, 0 30px 60px -30px rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.45), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04));color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.84)"><div class="scene-window-toolbar flex h-7 flex-none items-center gap-1 border-b px-3" style="border-color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.08)"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.18)"></span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.18)"></span><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.18)"></span><span class="ml-3 text-[10.5px]" style="color:rgb(var(--win-ink));border-bottom:1px solid rgb(var(--win-ink));padding-bottom:1px">Agent</span><span class="ml-auto font-mono text-[10px]" style="color:rgb(var(--win-ink) / 0.3)">Google Flights</span></div><div class="scene-window-content relative flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col"><div class="agent-example-task"><span>TASK</span><p>Find flights from Los Angeles to San Francisco.</p></div><video class="min-h-0 w-full flex-1 bg-white object-cover" src="/product-demos/agent-workflow.mp4" poster="/product-demos/agent-workflow.webp" preload="auto" muted="" loop="" playsInline="" disablePictureInPicture="" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></video></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><figcaption><span>Example workflow: searching Google Flights</span><button type="button" aria-label="Pause agents demo"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pause" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="14" y="3" width="5" height="18" rx="1"></rect><rect x="5" y="3" width="5" height="18" rx="1"></rect></svg>Pause</button></figcaption></figure></article></div></section><section id="production" class="editorial-section"><div class="editorial-section-label"><h2>In production</h2></div><div class="industrial-section-heading"><p class="editorial-section-intro">Session state, debugging, and isolation.</p></div><div class="home-operations-grid"><a href="/docs/sessions/profiles" class="home-operation-card"><div class="home-operation-copy"><h3>Saved state</h3><p>Reuse browser profiles with saved cookies and logins. Restore sandbox environments from memory snapshots.</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right editorial-operation-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a href="/docs/sessions/recordings" class="home-operation-card"><div class="home-operation-copy"><h3>Session recordings</h3><p>Watch browser sessions live and replay recordings to debug a run.</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right editorial-operation-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a class="home-operation-card" href="/sandboxes"><div class="home-operation-copy"><h3>Isolated execution</h3><p>Run commands in isolated virtual machines, separate from your application.</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right editorial-operation-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a href="/docs/quickstart" class="home-operation-card"><div class="home-operation-copy"><h3>SDKs and integrations</h3><p>Use Playwright, Puppeteer, the Node.js or Python SDKs, the CLI, or MCP.</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right editorial-operation-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="editorial-security"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><div><h3>Security and access controls</h3><p>Read about encryption, access controls, and independent security assessments.</p><a class="editorial-text-link" href="/security">Securi